#### 2. Partitioner (Custom Partitioning)

```java
// Control which reducer gets which keys
public class StringLengthPartitioner 
        extends Partitioner<Text, IntWritable> {
    
    @Override
    public int getPartition(Text key, IntWritable value, int numPartitions) {
        // Partition by string length
        int length = key.toString().length();
        return length % numPartitions;
    }
}

// Usage in job
job.setPartitionerClass(StringLengthPartitioner.class);
job.setNumReduceTasks(4);
```

