## Performance Tuning

### 1. Data Locality

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│          YARN Scheduler                  │
├──────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                          │
│  NODE-LOCAL: Task on same node as data   │ ← Best
│  RACK-LOCAL: Task on same rack as data   │ ← Good
│  OFF-RACK:   Task on different rack      │ ← Worst
│                                          │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

Scheduling Policy:
1. Try NODE-LOCAL first
2. If not available, try RACK-LOCAL
3. Last resort: OFF-RACK
```

