    job.setInputFormatClass(CombineTextInputFormat.class);
    
    // Sets maximum split size (multiple files per split)
    CombineFileInputFormat.setMaxInputSplitSize(job, 64 * 1024 * 1024);
    ```

25. **Explain how to choose between Hadoop and Spark for a project.**
    - **Use Hadoop when:**
      - Pure batch processing
      - Want native HDFS integration
      - Need proven stability
      - Cost constraints (older clusters)
    
    - **Use Spark when:**
      - Iterative algorithms (ML)
      - Need real-time streaming
      - Want multiple languages (Python, SQL)
      - Need interactive queries
      - In-memory processing beneficial
    
    - **Modern approach:** Use both - Spark for processing, HDFS for storage

